  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_HEADER.png\"></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_1.png\"></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這個模組新增了 11 種食物：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">5 種生肉塊</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">5 種熟肉塊</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1 種肉塊盒</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sqyX4jN\" alt=\"\" width=\"11\" height=\"111\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_1.png\"></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">生肉 = 1 點飢餓值，無飽和度</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">熟肉 = 2 點飢餓值，少量飽和度</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">肉塊盒 = 16 點飢餓值，大量飽和度</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_3.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">肉塊的食用速度比一般食物快 37.5%</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">肉類會產出相當於其飢餓值一半的肉塊</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">例如：雞肉為 6 點飢餓值，因此你會獲得 3 個肉塊</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果對合成配方有疑問，請使用 JEI 查詢</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_4.png\"></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RGtWl1_u5r4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcursed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_PROMO.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊上圖，選擇方案（建議至少 4GB），使用我的代碼 <strong>Cursed</strong>，即可在首次訂閱時享有 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，快來和朋友們一起玩吧！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加入我的 Discord 聊天同樂吧！</span><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://discord.gg/ZUah6a8Dqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_Da_Nuggets/BH_NU_5.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
